cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research repository, please cite the repository and the relevant theory papers listed in docs/LITERATURE_REVIEW.md."
title: "General Radiative Dark-Matter Nuclear-Current Theory"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/lm846802297-bit/radiative-dark-matter-nuclear-currents"
abstract: >-
  A research project developing three-body response kernels for dark-matter-line
  scalar radiation and matching them to vector, axial, and scalar nuclear
  currents, including AFH multipoles, chiral-EFT one- and two-body currents,
  and reproducible xenon predictions.
keywords:
  - dark matter direct detection
  - radiative scattering
  - three-body phase space
  - nuclear response
  - chiral effective field theory
  - xenon
